  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I try to join another world, the loading bar first goes up to 100%, then jumps back to 0% and restarts loading. After this loops several times, it kicks me back to my home world. What’s causing this? All mods except one I use regularly show as invalid/broken, and the loading progress keeps jumping back and forth.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJoin any other world. The loading bar hits 100% then jumps to 0% and reloads again. After looping several times, it sends me back to my home world. All avatar mods except my usual one become broken/error mods, and the progress bar keeps flickering between 0 and 100%.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 性能\n\n- Frequency: 总是\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-31_19-38-21.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_6a5e9da2-fe3b-443a-b329-2764df8f78fe/1/file)",
